      "title": "GNSS: fix GPS L1 subframe 1 word 10 dissection",
      "message": "GNSS: fix GPS L1 subframe 1 word 10 dissection\n\nFix dissection of GPS L1 subframe 1, word 10 by correctly dissecting the\ntwo (noninformation bearing) bits t before the parity bits. Before, a_f0\nwas erroneously dissected with 24 bits (but has 22 bits only).\n",
      "author_name": "Timo Warns",
      "author_email": "timow+git@DiningPhilosopher.DE",
